------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ComfyUI graphs (electron/engine/workflows/*.api.json)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These files are ComfyUI graphs in API format: lists of nodes and their settings.
The engine reads them node by node, so they carry no comment. Their
modification notice is electron/engine/workflows/NOTICE.md: for each derived
graph it gives the exact source, its licence and every change made for Mia.
electron/engine/workflows/index.json names, in French, the nodes the executors
set at run time.

Written by the author (Apache-2.0):
  depth_vda.api.json and seedvr2_node.api.json, written for Mia from the
  inputs of the custom nodes they drive (ComfyUI-Video-Depth-Anything and
  ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler).

Derived from example workflows published by Lightricks for LTX-2.5:
